  "description": "JanUI is a modern, Bootstrap 5-inspired WinForms control library for .NET 6 and .NET 8.\n      21 fully custom-painted, theme-aware controls with a 3-layer theming system,\n      8 built-in colour schemes, and full Visual Studio 2022 designer support.\n\n      Controls: JanAlert, JanButton, JanCard, JanChart, JanCheckBox,\n      JanCircularPictureBox, JanComboBox, JanDatePicker, JanDropdownMenu,\n      JanEllipseControl, JanInputDialog, JanLoaderControl, JanPanel,\n      JanProgressBar, JanRadioButton, JanScrollBar, JanSidebar,\n      JanSidePanel, JanTable, JanTextBox, JanToggleButton.",
